{"id":"en_sealed-in-blood-the-ex-wife-s-return","title":"Sealed in Blood: The Ex-Wife's Return","titleEn":"Sealed in Blood: The Ex-Wife's Return","description":"Stella is trapped at home while heavily pregnant by her abusive husband, Julian. When he takes her hospital bag to give to his mistress, Ruby, Stella endures a stillbirth and learns she can no longer have children. Driven by a need for revenge, she proves that Ruby's baby was not fathered by Julian and brings to light Ruby's involvement in a car crash that nearly killed Stella's brother, Miles. Ruby is taken into custody, while Julian faces ruin brought on by his own conduct and looming legal trouble. Stella ends the marriage and begins again with Miles as he recovers.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/sealed-in-blood-the-ex-wifes-return/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/sealed-in-blood-the-ex-wifes-return/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Elite Families","Modern","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djzz0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_sealed-in-blood-the-ex-wife-s-return_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djzz0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_sealed-in-blood-the-ex-wife-s-return_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djzz0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_sealed-in-blood-the-ex-wife-s-return_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djzz0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_sealed-in-blood-the-ex-wife-s-return_4","title"